msgid ""
"昇腾在 `quay.io/ascend/verl <https://quay.io/repository/ascend/verl?tab=tags&tag=latest>`_ 中托管每日构建的 A2/A3/950 镜像，基于 `Dockerfile <https://github.com/verl-project/verl/tree/main/docker/ascend>`_ 构建。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Ascend hosts the daily-built A2/A3/950 images in `quay.io/ascend/verl <https://quay.io/repository/ascend/verl?tab=tags&tag=latest>`_, built using the `Dockerfile <https://github.com/verl-project/verl/tree/main/docker/ascend>`_.\n"
""

